# More info: https://docs.docker.com/engine/reference/builder/#dockerignore-file
# Ignore everything by default and re-include only needed files
**

# Re-include Go source files (but not *_test.go)
!**/*.go
**/*_test.go

# Re-include Go module files
!go.mod
!go.sum

# Re-include the packaged Helm chart, which is compiled into the binary by
# //go:embed. Without it the build fails, because the embed pattern matches
# nothing. Produced by `make chart`.
!internal/chart/embedded/**
